I'm proud to reintroduce the Green New Deal for health with my good friend Ed Markey. The bill is pretty simple. It says that we need to prepare for climate disasters. I know about these in my home state, with the wildfires in Southern California. But whether it's wildfires or hurricanes, we need to have healthcare professionals, emergency professionals, in communities, ready to deal with climate events, and we need to reduce the climate emissions of our healthcare delivery service. I am hopeful that we can get broad support for the Green New Deal for Health.
